{%- comment -%}
  Include this near the top of the buy-buttons block inside main-product.liquid (or the
  equivalent product-form section for the theme). It hides the normal purchase UI for
  affiliate products and renders the affiliate button + disclosures instead.

  Usage inside main-product.liquid, wrapping the existing buy-box markup:

    {% assign is_affiliate = product.metafields.custom.affiliate_product.value %}
    {% if is_affiliate %}
      {% render 'affiliate-main-product-overrides', product: product %}
    {% else %}
      ... existing quantity selector / add-to-cart / buy-it-now / shipping estimator ...
    {% endif %}

  See theme/README.md for exactly which existing blocks to wrap.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="affiliate-product-panel">
  {%- render 'affiliate-price-disclaimer' -%}
  {%- render 'affiliate-product-button', product: product -%}
  {%- render 'affiliate-disclosure' -%}
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Explicitly does NOT render: quantity selector, Add to Cart, Buy It Now / dynamic
  checkout buttons, pickup availability, shipping estimator, inventory count/availability.
{%- endcomment -%}
